    {"name":"DimDate","description":"Reporting calendar","columns":[{"name":"DateKey","type":"int64"},{"name":"FullDate","type":"dateTime"},{"name":"Month","type":"string"},{"name":"Year","type":"int64"}],"measures":[{"name":"YTD Sales","expression":"TOTALYTD([Total Sales], DimDate[FullDate])"}]},
